["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/fileKind", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Describes if a given file is a directory or non-directory kind of file.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/impactStatement", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Explains why a VEX product is not affected by a vulnerability. It is an\nalternative in VexNotAffectedVulnAssessmentRelationship to the machine-readable\njustification label.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
